# Streamlit-First Output Rules

- The Streamlit dashboard is the canonical review surface.
- Default outputs must go to:
  - `dashboard_data/lifestyle-eval-candidate/` (patch JSONs)
  - `dashboard_data/lifestyle-eval-candidate/reports/` (markdown reports)
- Do not suggest or use the deprecated HTML `compare-runs` flow.
- When reviewing outputs, prefer `streamlit run streamlit_app.py` or the `review-dashboard` CLI.
